's Native 4K is a video generation model that directly outputs professional-grade 4K video in one step, eliminating the need for post-production upscaling\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://v3b.fal.media/files/b/0a9740b3/ctjfWfLHCPzYgYUcWgTAz_ea95e9bfce584107b6937050fa127cca.jpg\",\"modelUrl\":\"https://fal.run/fal-ai/kling-video/v3/4k/image-to-video\",\"githubUrl\":\"\",\"licenseType\":\"commercial\",\"date\":\"2026-04-22T08:25:28.440Z\",\"group\":{\"key\":\"kling-v3\",\"label\":\"Image to Video (4K)\"},\"pricingInfoOverride\":\"For every second of video you generated, you will be charged **$0.42** regardless of whether audio is on or off. For example, a **5s** video will cost **$2.10**.\",\"machineType\":null,\"examples\":[\"01e6ace2-f89c-4bab-9748-30f739b82ff3\",\"9f7cd726-acb2-447e-a61e-c264143e666b\"],\"authSkippable\":false,\"status\":\"public\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-04-23T14:59:09.550Z\",\"deprecated\":false,\"resultComparison\":false,\"hidePricing\":false,\"removed\":false,\"modelLab\":\"Kling\",\"modelLabId\":\"d8m36bkregj5ka3lrdbg\",\"modelFamily\":\"Kling v3\",\"hostingType\":\"proxy\",\"kind\":\"inference\",\"trainingEndpoints\":[]},{\"id\":\"fal-ai/kling-video/v3/4k/text-to-video\",\"modelId\":\"d7k8at4regjajshulo50\",\"isFavorited\":false,\"title\":\"Kling Video V3 Text to Video 4K\",\"category\":\"text-to-video\",\"tags\":[\"stylized\",\"transform\",\"lipsync\"],\"shortDescription\":\"Kling's Native 4K is a video generation model that directly outputs professional-grade 4K video in one step, eliminating the need for post-production upscaling\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://v3b.fal.media/files/b/0a970c17/m0f2ooX6jkF2UDw8yeU7w_0478d228dd9b4f58b26d5c833644465d.jpg\",\"modelUrl\":\"https://fal.run/fal-ai/kling-video/v3/4k/text-to-video\",\"githubUrl\":\"\",\"licenseType\":\"commercial\",\"date\":\"2026-04-22T08:23:16.624Z\",\"group\":{\"key\":\"kling-v3\",\"label\":\"Text to Video (4K)\"},\"pricingInfoOverride\":\"For every second of video you generated, you will be charged **$0.42** regardless of whether audio is on or off. For example, a **5s** video will cost **$2.10**.\",\"machineType\":null,\"examples\":[\"eabd9347-b253-4554-972a-67c54be428a8\",\"8ba75b68-844a-48ab-876d-ad08940b6ce7\",\"aa1cfc08-cac3-4dbc-9a03-4d9a6ae0d035\",\"1b2ce135-7648-4ade-adfd-da0d72fb6d9e\"],\"authSkippable\":false,\"status\":\"public\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-04-23T14:59:05.287Z\",\"deprecated\":false,\"resultComparison\":false,\"hidePricing\":false,\"removed\":false,\"modelLab\":\"Kling\",\"modelLabId\":\"d8m36bkregj5ka3lrdbg\",\"modelFamily\":\"Kling v3\",\"hostingType\":\"proxy\",\"kind\":\"inference\",\"trainingEndpoints\":[]},{\"id\":\"fal-ai/kling-video/v3/pro/image-to-video\",\"modelId\":\"d60g85kregjc54bdpii0\",\"isFavorited\":false,\"title\":\"Kling Video v3 Image to Video [Pro]\",\"category\":\"image-to-video\",\"tags\":[\"image-to-video\"],\"shortDescription\":\"Kling 3.0 Pro: Top-tier image-to-video with cinematic visuals, fluid motion, and native audio generation, with custom element support.\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://v3b.fal.media/files/b/0a9c2fb3/yPzcdzINnY5RdSoEqHc8G_382d4ec9337344ccaacf5599057f6cd0.jpg\",\"modelUrl\":\"https://fal.run/fal-ai/kling-video/v3/pro/image-to-video\",\"githubUrl\":\"\",\"licenseType\":\"commercial\",\"date\":\"2026-02-04T15:48:44.935Z\",\"group\":{\"key\":\"kling-v3\",\"label\":\"Image to Video (pro)\"},\"pricingInfoOverride\":\"For every second of video you generated, you will be charged **$0.112** (audio off) or **$0.168** (audio on), if voice control is used while generating audio you will be charged **$0.196**. For example, a 5s video with audio on and voice control will cost **$0.98**\",\"machineType\":null,\"examples\":[\"0e739f78-45fd-4529-a24e-c5bc8fc19a36\",\"5f339943-baf0-4fea-af8a-874fc136dcea\",\"fe8fb525-738f-42b6-8678-f80ca3ef18ce\"],\"authSkippable\":false,\"status\":\"public\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-02-04T15:48:44.935Z\",\"deprecated\":false,\"resultComparison\":false,\"hidePricing\